## This 17.0.0 line

**`17.0.0-SNAPSHOT`**: Java **17**, **Jakarta** committed types, **26** services (full MCA), `src/main/resources/HI_*.wsdl`, `hi_override/` xmldsig package. Default build compiles committed sources. Regen (**`-Pregenerate-sources`**) requires licensed **`wsdls/xml/`** locally. See **MAINTAINERS.md**.

## Build

- JDK **17**, from repo root: `mvn -B "-Dgpg.skip=true" clean verify` (quote `-D` on PowerShell).
- Default build uses **committed** `src/main/java` - no wsimport.

## vs hi-b2b-client-java

| | **hi-wsdl-java** | **hi-b2b-client-java** |
|---|---|---|
| Delivers | WSDL on classpath + generated types | Facade clients, TLS, signing |
| Artifact | `hi-wsdl` | `hi-b2b-client` |

Publish **`hi-wsdl`** first. Consumers that pin **`${project.version}`** (including **`hi-b2b-client`**) use the same coordinate on each line (**8.0.0**, **11.0.0**, **17.0.0**, and so on).

## Doc split

- **`documentation-standards.mdc`**: implementor-first, Maven Central default, local/OS sections, relative paths, no secrets
- **`README.md`**: integrators (Maven Central default)
- **`CONTRIBUTING.md`**: build from source, local SNAPSHOT, regeneration notes
